+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "HTTPS everywhere, no exceptions": plain HTTP is not permitted, and that includes internal hosts. All connections, internal ones too, must use HTTPS. The project also records that certificate verification stays on in all builds.
